  "details": "The glyphs on the rock rings behind the portals are noticably pixelated. I'm unsure of how these are currently implemented, but using a single texture sheet with all of the glyphs, mapped to the rings using a second UV map is likely the way to go. Alternatively, they could be placed using single quads using a cutout material for each glyph, mapped to the same texture sheet, though I am unsure about the performance implication of cutout transparency on mobile.\n\nI only checked this on PC, but these issues are likely also on other platforms.",
